import LOEIS.A307.A307335.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A307335

A fractal quinary sequence: For all n >= 1, underline the term with index n + a(n) + 1; then the two subsequences of underlined terms and of non-underlined terms are both equal to the sequence itself.

The 112 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A307335

